|kde_governance_laboratory_artifact_naming_conventions
  |document_id=GOV-NAMING-001
  |version=3.0.0
  |date=2026-07-25
  |status=APPROVED
  |authority=KDE Governance
|purpose
|artifact_naming_rules
  |rule_1_prefix_requirements
    |table
      ||['Artifact Type', 'Directory', 'Prefix', 'Example']
      ||['Investigation (KDE)', '`investigations/`', '`KDE-INV-`', '`KDE-INV-001/`']
      ||['Investigation (Project)', '`investigations/`', '`PROJECT-INV-`', '`PROJECT-INV-001/`']
      ||['Experiment', '`experiments/`', '`PROJECT-EXP-`', '`PROJECT-EXP-001/`']
      ||['Decision', '`decisions/`', '`TDR-`', '`TDR-001.md`']
      ||['Implementation', '`implementations/`', '`PROJECT-IMP-`', '`PROJECT-IMP-001/`']
      ||['Review', '`reviews/`', '`PROJECT-REV-`', '`PROJECT-REV-001.md`']
      ||['Testing Asset', '`testing/`', '`TEST-`', '`TEST-ASSET-001.md`']
      ||['Mock Device', '`testing/mocks/`', '`TEST-MOCK-`', '`TEST-MOCK-MASTER-001/`']
      ||['Simulator', '`testing/simulators/`', '`TEST-SIM-`', '`TEST-SIM-DNP3-001/`']
      ||['Test Fixture', '`testing/fixtures/`', '`TEST-FIX-`', '`TEST-FIX-CERTS-001/`']
    |rule_2_directory_placement
      |table
        ||['Prefix', 'Valid Directory']
        ||['`KDE-INV-*`', '`investigations/`']
        ||['`PROJECT-INV-*`', '`investigations/`']
        ||['`PROJECT-EXP-*`', '`experiments/`']
        ||['`TDR-*`', '`decisions/`']
        ||['`PROJECT-IMP-*`', '`implementations/`']
        ||['`PROJECT-REV-*`', '`reviews/`']
        ||['`TEST-*`', '`testing/`']
        ||['`TEST-MOCK-*`', '`testing/mocks/`']
        ||['`TEST-SIM-*`', '`testing/simulators/`']
        ||['`TEST-FIX-*`', '`testing/fixtures/`']
      |rule_3_id_sequence
        |investigations_kde=Sequential `KDE-INV-001`, `KDE-INV-002`, etc.
        |investigations_project=Sequential `PROJECT-INV-001`, `PROJECT-INV-002`, etc.
        |experiments=Sequential `PROJECT-EXP-001`, `PROJECT-EXP-002`, etc.
        |decisions=Sequential `TDR-001`, `TDR-002`, etc.
        |implementations=Sequential `PROJECT-IMP-001`, `PROJECT-IMP-002`, etc.
        |reviews=Sequential `PROJECT-REV-001`, `PROJECT-REV-002`, etc.
        |testing_assets=Sequential `TEST-001`, `TEST-002`, etc.
        |mock_devices=Sequential `TEST-MOCK-001`, `TEST-MOCK-002`, etc.
        |simulators=Sequential `TEST-SIM-001`, `TEST-SIM-002`, etc.
        |test_fixtures=Sequential `TEST-FIX-001`, `TEST-FIX-002`, etc.
    |enforcement
      |pre-creation_check
        |violation_detection
          |table
            ||['Violation Type', 'Example', 'Required Action']
            ||['Wrong prefix', '`investigations/DNP3-EXP-004/`', 'Rename to `DNP3-INV-XXX`']
            ||['Wrong directory', '`experiments/DNP3-INV-012/`', 'Relocate to `investigations/`']
            ||['Duplicate ID', 'Two `DNP3-EXP-003/`', 'Reassign one ID']
      |rationale
        |traceability=Unique, predictable IDs enable quick artifact location
        |consistency=Standardized naming prevents confusion
        |automation=Enables tooling for artifact management
        |scientific_validity=Clear identification supports evidence chains
      |related_policies
        |items
          ||GOV-AUTH-001: Authorization Requirements
          ||GOV-EVIDENCE-001: Evidence Preservation Standards
          ||TESTING-GOV-001: Testing Governance Rules (in laboratory/testing/governance/)
      |status=ENFORCED
      |review_date=Upon any naming conflict incident